on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  4] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, 0>
  [  6] extcall 25 .............................. puppetSound(1, 0)
  [  8] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 11] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2, 0>
  [ 14] extcall 25 .............................. puppetSound(2, 0)
  [ 16] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 19] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 20] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <3, 0>
  [ 22] extcall 25 .............................. puppetSound(3, 0)
  [ 24] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 27] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 28] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <4, 0>
  [ 30] extcall 25 .............................. puppetSound(4, 0)
